> A data-stream tunnel accelerating into the frame — three words slam in left-to-right, each bigger and faster, with motion-blur streaks, pulsing crosshairs, and sparks tearing through the HUD. The progress bars race, the trackers lock on, and by SHIP the frame is shaking with velocity.

